# ============================================================
#  Fix 3 (b): recepcion DENTRO del bucle del Poker (bloqueante)
#  'alfa' lo lee el bucle principal al entrar; 'bravo' SOLO puede
#  haberlo leido el bucle del Poker (el principal ya no corre).
# ============================================================
wait 300
pot 1000
wait 200
tap morse
pot 220
wait 250
expect text Poker
lora rx alfa
lora rx bravo
in 0 morse down
in 120 morse up
run 900
expect serial Guardado: alfa
expect serial Guardado: bravo
print Fix 3: RX DENTRO del Poker verificada
